      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1937923289319428454",
      "text": "[6:11PM] #Alausa_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic movement on Obafemi Awolowo Way from Barrack, Radio, and Allen Junction to Olowu, but with increased traffic approaching Olowu and Ikeja underneath the bridge due to spillover from Ikeja Along overpass.\nBusy traffic conditions approaching Allen Junction, Radio, and Barrack onward Olowopopo, particularly around traffic lights.\nSmooth traffic flow on Mobolaji Johnson Avenue from Old Tollgate to Alausa Intersection, and on the stretch from Dr. Nurudeen Olowopopo to Otedola underneath the bridge.\nSteady movement on Aromire linking Adeniyi Jones, Akora Villa to Hacco, with a good return journey, although busy approaching Allen Junction.\nGood traffic movement on Lateef Jakande Road from Coca-Cola Junction to Mobil, Cadbury, and Agidingbi, but with increased traffic from First Gate, Wemco Junction to Omole Roundabout.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
