      "text": "[6:50PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nHigh traffic influx inward journey from Eyin Eyo to Balogun Street.\nBusy traffic conditions from Tinubu Square to Nnamdi Azikiwe Street, en route Carter Bridge via Tom Jones Intersection, due to market activities in the area.\nSmooth traffic flow from Oyebanji Roundabout to Adeniji Adele Road, through Oba's Palace and Police Post.\nFaster traffic movement at Illubinrin connecting Carter Bridge, inward journey to Ijora Olopa, as well as Oyingbo.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
